Z||000000||BAM-BAM||05-24-2000||11:49 PM||||    I had talked to Paul some time ago about the tail lights on his V-8 notchback. He told me he was working on a light kit for the notchback that resembled the newer model GT tail lights. Well, here it is, for those of you who might be considering this totaly awesome mod. <A HREF="http://www.xnet.com/~paulv" TARGET=_blank>www.xnet.com/~paulv</A>   click on the title; Lighted rear "PONTIAC" lenses. I think you all will like it. I liked it so much that I ordered new lenses from Pontiac just for the application. The lenses cost me about $71.00 each so I'll have to wait a while for the kit. I just bought lowering springs, shocks and stuts, so my budget is a little depleated for a couple of weeks.<P> I hope you like them.<P> Later, BAM-BAM  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <p>[This message has been edited by BAM-BAM (edited 05-24-2000).]||||reg||12
